      "id": "t08_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Palettes and colour spreads\n\n`Palette` emits a Spread<Color>. To colour a 64-point grid from a 4-stop palette, use `CycleSpread` to repeat the palette until it has 64 elements.\n\nThe ForEach takes two inputs (vec2 and color) and runs once per pair.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Palettes and colour spreads\n\n`Palette` emits a Spread<Color>. To colour a 64-point grid from a 4-stop palette, use `CycleSpread` to repeat the palette until it has 64 elements.\n\nThe ForEach takes two inputs (vec2 and color) and runs once per pair.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
